(text "ADC & CONTROL\nCS5343 24-bit stereo ADC, MASTER mode (10k SDOUT pull-up), MCLK 12.288 MHz from Si5351 -> Fs 48 kHz,\nBCLK/LRCK/SDOUT go to the ESP32-S3 I2S peripheral (slave RX). L = V_A channel, R = V_B channel.\nPCA9555 @0x20: IO0_0..4 range relays, IO0_5 BYPASS, IO0_6 DDS reset. Si5351 @0x60 shares I2C.\nJ3 -> JC3248W535EN: P3 (GPIO17 SDA, GPIO18 SCL, GND), P2 (GPIO15 BCLK, GPIO16 WS, GPIO7 DIN,\nGPIO6 W_CLK, GPIO9 FQ_UD, GPIO14 DATA). AFE is powered from its own USB-C." (at 15 15 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid 6e04581e-5a00-4997-876b-fdcdebcef82f))
(text "J3 pinout: 1,2 GND | 3 SDA=GPIO17 | 4 SCL=GPIO18 | 5 BCLK=GPIO15 | 6 WS=GPIO16 |\n7 DIN=GPIO7 | 8 W_CLK=GPIO6 | 9 FQ_UD=GPIO9 | 10 DATA=GPIO14" (at 110 185 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 29f0a66e-c7c6-4be2-8403-c45d3068bb88))
)
